<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\アポカリプティック2.ogg" "SE2" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "700" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Just toward where I could hear the voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Toward where I could hear the voice calling me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Fighting the pain, pushing against the strong headwind―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I kept moving my feet, single-mindedly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Toward the one who would help me.<PG>
I could hear a voice telling me of danger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could hear a voice that would keep me away from that danger―a voice guiding me.<PG>
Why can I hear a voice like this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whose voice is it?<PG>
Is this intuition an ability of my own?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or is someone telling me through something like telepathy, and my ability is sensing it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If anything, the latter feels right.<PG>
In other words, strictly speaking, I can't detect danger. I can hear a voice that tells me of danger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The person who tells me of danger...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come to think of it, the dream I had today at <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s house―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "NORMAL" "FALSE" "100" "100"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\公園夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "5000" "PASS"}
This place is... Central Park?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The owner of the voice is in here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whoever it is will surely help me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\中央公園素材\中央公園内部夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\中央公園素材\御神木夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The goshinboku, glowing dully in a color that was neither quite pink nor quite blue.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was this color from the moonlight, or did it have something to do with this voice warning me of danger?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜吹雪風船なし.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "300" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n5000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n4\r\n-482\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n4\r\n-482\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When I entered the closed-off Central Park, the wind grew even stronger, and the storm of cherry petals blinded me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My feet turned on their own toward one cherry tree―the goshinboku.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\赤い人立ち.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "200" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"That's..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Beyond the storm of petals, someone was standing beneath the goshinboku.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had seen that figure before, but I couldn't tell who it was.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because the person was bright red all over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Like that person I saw in my dream.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"The one who called me... was it you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The red person didn't move a muscle.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I approached the red person.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\赤い人バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
And as the person's form grew clearer, the bizarre appearance became clear as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The person had no skin, and the flesh of the entire body was laid bare.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Na...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">tsu...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">mi..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A voice that sounded in pain, but familiar, and somehow reassuring.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no mistaking this voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's <STYLE ID="4">my dad</STYLE>.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\夢見る憧憬.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...? Why are you in a place like this...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Why do you look like this...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But there was no answer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, he was trying to say something, but he probably couldn't get his voice out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He only moved his mouth painfully, with the sound of breath leaking out, hhh, hhh.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! It's me, Natsumi! How did this happen..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then <STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE> slowly moved one painful-looking red hand
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\赤い人手.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "960" "B" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{QUAKE "人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "0" "5" "0" "30"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n480\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n480\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
{MESON "500"}
and gently laid it on my left elbow.<PG>
The touch of that hand was faint, as if the wind itself were touching me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I felt no disgust.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because even touched by a hand of bare flesh, I could somehow feel its warmth―<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"It's... all right now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I know this is just my imagination.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But with that hand on me, hearing that voice―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
the pain drained smoothly out of my elbow.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then he laid that hand on my cheek.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ上気味.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "400" "B" "200" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Trust... in... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Mixed in with his breath, that was what I heard, clearly, in <STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE>'s voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... trust her...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"In everyone... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">everyone is... on your side."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE> clumsily moved the bare muscles of his face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It looked just as if he were smiling at me gently.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\キーン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n11\r\n100\r\n5000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The hand that had been resting on my cheek crumbled away, fluttering like a storm of cherry petals.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Dancing in the wind like flower petals, his form crumbled away―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2,111" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYMOVIE "赤い人消える.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "NORMAL" "TRUE" "0" "255"}
{WAITPLAY "ムービー" "CLICK"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{PLAYMOVIE "桜吹雪風船なし.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "300" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\中央公園素材\中央公園内部夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\中央公園素材\御神木夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And then <STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE> vanished, as if drawn into the cherry tree.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Wait! Why!? What on earth is...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once again a thick storm of cherry petals blinded me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no answer from <STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Only the spring wind raged.<PG>
The strength went out of me, and my knees touched the petal-covered ground.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So that's how it was...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When they said this morning's incident had to do with me, that's what it meant...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE>, you were warning me in the dream I had at <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s house, weren't you.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I looked up at the cherry tree, my vision blurred even more.
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n5000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The storm of petals and the tears welling in my eyes dulled my optic nerves.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The color of the petals, dancing like a spray of blood, ran in my tears, and I could perceive only a dark red blur.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if I were shedding tears of blood―<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE> is gone now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But at the very end, he told me something to help me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To trust <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE>... in that state―he had been skinned, and died.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, he endured the agony, appeared before me, and tried to help me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "111" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHGVOL "BGM" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "500" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "3000" "WAIT"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "WAIT"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{MESON "500"}
Footsteps from behind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I blinked once, the tears that had blurred my sight ran down my cheeks all at once.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
At the same time the wind weakened, and the scene grew clear.<PG>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\ギン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Ugh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The pain in my elbow came back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if what had just happened were a dream, the scenery and the pain both pulled me back to reality.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\中央公園素材\中央公園内部夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The shinigami turned its gaze through the Noh mask on me, as I sat there clutching my elbow.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Perhaps it knew I no longer had the strength to run; it just kept staring at me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if answering that gaze, I <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="にら">glared</STYLE> hard back at the eyes that the Noh mask should have hidden.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"You're the one who killed </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, aren't you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no answer, and no sign that it would attack me or come any closer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that case, I went on.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"You made it look like </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> cursed me, so you could kill me, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Why... Who are you...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just then, I saw someone else running toward us.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢全身.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"That's far enough! The park is completely surrounded! There's nowhere to run!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Ise-san</STYLE>'s shout.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Before I knew it, a large unit had surrounded the park.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, the shinigami didn't move a muscle, and didn't take its eyes off me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Several of my shots should have hit you earlier. You're wearing a bulletproof vest, aren't you? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　How did you even get hold of something like that... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">And you know every killing technique there is. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Who is it?</STYLE> <STYLE ID="6">Your accomplice..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even to <STYLE ID="6">Ise-san</STYLE>'s questions, the shinigami gave no reaction.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"With </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, you killed six people in the past, then murdered </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Ryoji Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, and attempted the murder of </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">I am placing you under arrest on suspicion of murder and attempted murder! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Shinigami... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">no... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">!"</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then the shinigami put its hands to its hood and Noh mask.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And from beneath them―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{STOPSND "SE" "1000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神茜大.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\怖い効果音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n100\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
